"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} in Finder, right-click the file, hold Option and choose "
"{ph2}Copy \"…\" as Pathname{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0} macOS :{ph1} di Finder, klik kanan file, tahan Opsi, dan pilih "
"{ph2}Salin \" ... \" sebagai Nama Jalur{ph3}."

