#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:449
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}See the full investigation and assembly-to-C comparison{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Lihat investigasi lengkap dan perbandingan assembly-to-C{ph1}"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:456
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Try it with your own binary"
msgstr "Cobalah dengan biner Anda sendiri"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../get-started/#native" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:457
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Connect a native analysis provider{ph1}, then give your agent a local "
"executable or library and a feature to investigate. Useful starting "
"questions include “How is this file parsed?” or “Which function handles this"
" menu action?”"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Hubungkan analisis penyedia program kode mesin{ph1}, lalu berikan agen "
"Anda executable atau pustaka lokal dan fitur untuk diselidiki. Pertanyaan "
"awal yang berguna termasuk \"Bagaimana file ini diuraikan?\"atau\" Fungsi "
"mana yang menangani tindakan menu ini?”"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:464
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"If you already know a function name or address, you can query it from the "
"terminal. For a configured Ghidra installation:"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda sudah mengetahui nama atau alamat fungsi, Anda dapat menanyakannya"
" dari terminal. Untuk instalasi Ghidra yang dikonfigurasi:"

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:470
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid "Function analysis"
msgstr "Analisis fungsi"

#. {ph0}: <code>main</code>
#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:483
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the target path and {ph0} with your own function name or address. "
"Each CLI invocation imports and analyzes the binary, then closes its "
"session. Your agent's MCP queries reuse the imported binary while that "
"session is open."
msgstr ""
"Ganti jalur target dan {ph0} dengan nama atau alamat fungsi Anda sendiri. "
"Setiap pemanggilan CLI mengimpor dan menganalisis biner, lalu menutup "
"sesinya. Kueri MCP agen Anda menggunakan kembali biner yang diimpor saat "
"sesi tersebut dibuka."

#: website/public/guides/native/index.html:489
msgctxt "page:guides/native/index.html"
msgid ""
"Read the pseudocode alongside instructions and references. When a result "
"leaves a call or value unresolved, use that location as the next question."
msgstr ""
"Baca pseudocode di samping instruksi dan referensi. Saat hasil membuat "
"panggilan atau nilai tidak terselesaikan, gunakan lokasi tersebut sebagai "
"pertanyaan berikutnya."

