#: website/public/get-started/index.html:215
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}4. Try an investigation{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}4. Coba penyelidikan{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#native">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:216
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Other targets and providers{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Target dan penyedia analisis lainnya{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:223
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "1. Prepare your computer"
msgstr "1. Siapkan komputermu"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:224
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Use the computer where your target files are stored. A local coding agent "
"can read those files and run tools for you."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan komputer tempat berkas target disimpan. Agen pemrograman lokal bisa "
"membaca berkas itu dan menjalankan alat untukmu."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:249
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Commands go in the terminal. Prompts labeled “Your coding agent” go in the "
"agent's chat."
msgstr ""
"Masukkan perintah di terminal. Prompt berlabel “Agen pemrogramanmu” "
"dimasukkan ke percakapan agen."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:305
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Download the Node.js installer{ph1} if winget is unavailable."
msgstr "{ph0}Unduh penginstal Node.js{ph1} jika winget tidak tersedia."

#. {ph0}: <em>
#. {ph1}: </em>
#. {ph2}: <code>npx</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>npx.cmd</code>
#. {ph4}: <code>npm.cmd</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:311
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"If PowerShell later says {ph0}\"running scripts is disabled on this "
"system\"{ph1} when you run {ph2}, use {ph3} instead. For npm, use {ph4}:"
msgstr ""
"Jika nanti PowerShell menampilkan {ph0}\"running scripts is disabled on this"
" system\"{ph1} saat kamu menjalankan {ph2}, gunakan {ph3} sebagai gantinya. "
"Untuk npm, gunakan {ph4}:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:409
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Make a working folder for your agent"
msgstr "Buat folder kerja untuk agenmu"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:410
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "In your terminal, make a folder for the exercise, then move into it:"
msgstr "Di terminal, buat folder untuk latihan ini lalu masuk ke dalamnya:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:429
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Keep this terminal open for the next step. If you already have a working "
"folder, open it instead."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan terminal ini terbuka untuk langkah berikutnya. Jika sudah punya "
"folder kerja, buka folder itu saja."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:436
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "2. Choose a coding agent"
msgstr "2. Pilih agen pemrograman"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:437
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent is the AI you talk to. REA supplies the inspection tools it uses."
" Pick one client below; open its instructions if you haven't used it before."
msgstr ""
"Agenmu adalah AI yang kamu ajak bicara. REA menyediakan alat pemeriksaan "
"yang digunakannya. Pilih satu aplikasi di bawah; buka petunjuknya jika belum"
" pernah menggunakannya."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:443
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Codex · use your ChatGPT account"
msgstr "Codex · gunakan akun ChatGPT-mu"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:491
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Choose “Sign in with ChatGPT”, complete the browser sign-in, then return to "
"the terminal. When the message box appears, continue to step 3."
msgstr ""
"Pilih “Sign in with ChatGPT”, selesaikan proses masuk di browser, lalu "
"kembali ke terminal. Saat kotak pesan muncul, lanjutkan ke langkah 3."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/codex/cli" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:496
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Codex installation and sign-in{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Instalasi Codex dan masuk akun{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:503
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Cursor, Windsurf or VS Code · use an editor"
msgstr "Cursor, Windsurf, atau VS Code · gunakan editor"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:505
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Install the editor for your operating system and sign in."
msgstr "Instal editor untuk sistem operasimu dan masuk ke akun."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:508
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Open the rea-work folder you made in step 1."
msgstr "Buka folder rea-work yang kamu buat pada langkah 1."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:527
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Claude Code · use your Claude account"
msgstr "Claude Code · gunakan akun Claude-mu"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:528
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Install using the command for your operating system:"
msgstr "Instal dengan perintah untuk sistem operasimu:"

#. {ph0}: <code>claude</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:557
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Reopen your terminal, return to your working folder and run {ph0}. Follow "
"the sign-in prompts. Access uses an eligible Claude subscription or a "
"configured API account."
msgstr ""
"Buka kembali terminal, masuk ke folder kerja, lalu jalankan {ph0}. Ikuti "
"petunjuk masuk akun. Akses memerlukan langganan Claude yang memenuhi syarat "
"atau akun API yang sudah dikonfigurasi."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:562
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Claude Code installation and account options{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Instalasi Claude Code dan pilihan akun{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:569
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Claude Desktop · use a desktop chat"
msgstr "Claude Desktop · gunakan aplikasi percakapan desktop"

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://claude.ai/download">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#. {ph2}: <a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/docs/client-
#. configuration.md#claude-desktop" >
#. {ph3}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:593
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Download Claude Desktop{ph1} · {ph2}Claude Desktop connection "
"details{ph3}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Unduh Claude Desktop{ph1} · {ph2}Detail koneksi Claude Desktop{ph3}"

#. {ph0}: <code>opencode</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>/connect</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:618
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Run {ph0} in your working folder. Use {ph1} in its chat to connect your "
"model account, then select a model."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan {ph0} di folder kerja. Gunakan {ph1} dalam percakapannya untuk "
"menghubungkan akun modelmu, lalu pilih model."

#. {ph0}: <a href="https://opencode.ai/docs/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:623
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}OpenCode installation and model setup{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Instalasi OpenCode dan penyiapan model{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:630
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "All supported clients and setup IDs"
msgstr "Semua aplikasi yang didukung dan ID penyiapannya"

#. {ph0}: <code>--client</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:631
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"The npm 6.4.0 release supports the clients below. Use the ID with {ph0} when"
" choosing a client explicitly."
msgstr ""
"Rilis npm 6.4.0 mendukung aplikasi di bawah. Gunakan ID bersama {ph0} saat "
"memilih aplikasi secara eksplisit."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:639
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Client"
msgstr "Aplikasi"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:640
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Setup ID"
msgstr "ID penyiapan"

