"{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Contoh pertanyaan · Permainan "
"dinosaurus"

#: website/public/index.html:616
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "2. Find the speed rule"
msgstr "2. Temukan aturan kecepatannya"

#: website/public/index.html:617
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"REA lets the agent read the game’s running code. The speed starts at 6 and "
"increases a little each update while it is below 13."
msgstr ""
"REA memungkinkan agen membaca kode permainan yang sedang berjalan. Kecepatan"
" dimulai dari 6 dan naik sedikit setiap pembaruan selama masih di bawah 13."

#: website/public/index.html:624
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "3. Play the result"
msgstr "3. Mainkan hasilnya"

#: website/public/index.html:625
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"We rebuilt that rule in the mini-game below and added a speed slider. Press "
"Play, then choose your own speed."
msgstr ""
"Kami membuat ulang aturan itu dalam permainan kecil di bawah dan menambahkan"
" penggeser kecepatan. Mulai bermain, lalu pilih kecepatanmu."

#: website/public/index.html:690
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"Enable JavaScript to play. You can still read the rule and open the source "
"code below."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan JavaScript untuk bermain. Kamu tetap bisa membaca aturan dan "
"membuka kode sumber di bawah."

#: website/public/index.html:808
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"The % button does different things after + and ×. Let’s find both rules and "
"try them in a small calculator."
msgstr ""
"Tombol % bekerja berbeda setelah + dan ×. Mari temukan kedua aturan dan "
"mencobanya dalam kalkulator kecil."

