msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"The % button does different things after + and ×. Let’s find both rules and "
"try them in a small calculator."
msgstr ""
"Il pulsante % si comporta diversamente dopo + e ×. Troviamo entrambe le "
"regole e proviamole in una piccola calcolatrice."

